@startuml SubagentBoundary
!include drawio-theme.puml
title Subagent 生命周期与上层 Multi-agent 边界
left to right direction

class "AgentRuntime" as Runtime <<external_subdomain>>
class "业务编排 / Multi-agent Builder" as BusinessMultiAgent <<external_subdomain>>
class "Run Domain" as RunDomain <<external_subdomain>>
class "Permission System" as Permission <<external_subdomain>>
class "Session Domain" as SessionDomain <<external_subdomain>>

package "Agent Kernel System" as Kernel <<bounded_context>> {
  package "Structured Subagent" as SubagentModule <<domain_module>> {
    interface ChildRunPort <<inbound_port>> {
      +submitChild(parentRunId, spec, envelopeRef): ChildRunRef
      +join(parentRunId, childRunIds): JoinResultRef
      +cancelTree(scopeId, reason)
    }
    interface RunSchedulerPort <<outbound_port>> {
      +enqueueChild(parentRunId, spec, envelopeRef): RunId
      +cancelTree(scopeId, reason)
      +queryTerminal(runIds): RunSnapshot[]
    }
    interface SessionBranchPort <<outbound_port>> {
      +branch(parentSessionId, contextSelection): SessionId
    }
    interface PermissionDecisionPort <<outbound_port>> {
      +authorizeDelegation(proposal, envelopeRef): PermissionDecision
    }
    interface PermitValidationPort <<outbound_port>> {
      +validateAndConsume(permitRef, actionDigest, envelopeRef): ConsumeResult
    }

    class SubagentCoordinator <<application_service>>
    class AgentExecutionScope <<aggregate_root>> {
      +scopeId: ExecutionScopeId
      +rootRunId: RunId
      +status: OPEN|DRAINING|CLOSED
      +activeChildCount: int
      +version: long
    }
    class DelegationPolicy <<value_object>> {
      +maxDepth: int
      +maxChildren: int
      +maxConcurrency: int
    }
    class DelegationSpec <<value_object>> {
      +agentDefinitionRef: AgentDefinitionRef
      +contextSelection: ContextSelection
      +budgetSubset: RunBudget
      +deadlineAt: Instant
      +isolatedSession: boolean
    }
    class ParentChildRunLink <<entity>> {
      +parentRunId: RunId
      +childRunId: RunId
      +childSessionId: SessionId?
      +status: CREATED|RUNNING|JOINED|CANCELLED|TRANSFERRED
      +resultRef: ArtifactReference?
    }

    ChildRunPort <|.. SubagentCoordinator
    SubagentCoordinator --> AgentExecutionScope
    SubagentCoordinator --> RunSchedulerPort
    SubagentCoordinator --> SessionBranchPort
    SubagentCoordinator --> PermissionDecisionPort
    SubagentCoordinator --> PermitValidationPort
    AgentExecutionScope *-- DelegationPolicy
    AgentExecutionScope *-- ParentChildRunLink
    ParentChildRunLink *-- DelegationSpec
  }
}

Runtime --> ChildRunPort : Fork / Join / Cancel
RunSchedulerPort --> RunDomain : 统一创建与调度 Child Run
SessionBranchPort --> SessionDomain : 仅需上下文隔离时创建 Child Session
PermissionDecisionPort --> Permission : 权限、预算、Deadline 求交集
PermitValidationPort --> Permission : 创建 Child 前消费 Permit

BusinessMultiAgent --> RunDomain : 通用 Run/Session 接口\n组建多个独立 Agent
BusinessMultiAgent -[#DC2626,dashed]-> SubagentModule : 禁止把 Team/Role/仲裁写入 Kernel

note bottom of AgentExecutionScope
  Kernel 只拥有结构化 Child Run 生命周期，不拥有 Multi-agent 团队模型。
  Parent 终态前必须 Join、Cancel 或受控移交所有 Child。
  Session 不对应进程；Child 仅在需要上下文隔离时派生 Session。
end note
@enduml
